{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19772","headline":"伤哉行 · 孟郊","name":"伤哉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆毒蔓贞松，一枝难久荣。\n岂知黄庭客，仙骨生不成。\n春色舍芳蕙，秋风遶枯茎。\n弹琴不成曲，始觉知音倾。\n馆月改旧照，吊宾写余情。\n还舟空江上，波浪送铭旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}